			"notes": "## Isles+  |  v1.0.2 Release\nMove and resize everything Isles+ puts on your screen, search the menu, and a pile of new trackers: Void Rift, Eggs, Food Buffs, Berries, Treasure Chests and gatherables.\nUse `/ip` to open the menu.\n\n### 🖥️  HUD Editor\n**Edit HUD** - New button at the top of `/ip` (or `/ip hud`). Drag anything Isles+ draws to move it, scroll or drag its corner to resize it\n**Every HUD element** - World Bosses, Rift Rank, Inventory Full, Item on Ground, Bonus QTE, Plushie Note, Inventory Search bar, Berry Alert, Food Buff, Void Rift alert and timer, Egg Timer and Egg Warning\n**Stick to Scoreboard** - the Rift Rank badge and Food Buff line follow the scoreboard at any size, or can be placed freely\n**World Bosses Background** - Panel background can be faded out\n\n### 🎨  Menu\n**Search** - New search box at the top of `/ip`, find features on every page. Right click it to clear\n**New Pages** - QoL, Inventory, Node Farming, Rift and Keybinds\n**New Fonts** - New typeface in the menu, the Minecraft font everywhere in game\n\n### 🏝️  QoL\n**Void Rift Timer** - Alerts 1 hr, 10 min and 5 min before the Void Rift, with a countdown in the corner\n**Egg Timer** - A warning 5 min before eggs spawn, then a countdown\n**Food Buff Timer** - Your active dish and its time left, under the scoreboard\n**Treasure Chests** - New waypoints on sunken chests\n**Boss Timers** - estimated times now read `12:34 (stale)` instead of `~12:34`\n**Plushie Finder** - new option to skip plushie #1 (locked behind the tutorial), and a reminder when `/plushies` pages still need opening\n\n### 🎒  Inventory\n**Quick Actions** - Buttons next to your inventory that run your commands, with an option to hide their background\n**Roll Percent** - Item tooltips show how well each stat rolled\n**Item Age** - Item tooltips show how old the item is\n**Storage Counts** - Storage slots show the real amount instead of 99\n**Inventory Search** - Right click the search bar to clear it\n\n### ⛏️  Node Farming\n**Harvestable Highlighter** - Glows Whisperleaf, Fibers, Apples, Mushrooms, Kelp, Tanglewood Vines, Driftstone and Cobwebs through walls, each with its own toggle, colour and waypoint\n**Berry Alert** - A title and a sound when a berry spawns while you farm\n\n### ⌨️  Keybinds\n**Boss Timers** - new keybind that opens `/bossary`\n\n### 🛠️  Fixes\n**Node Depleted & Regen Pings** - work again\n**Mod-only Sounds** - only Isles+ sounds and menu clicks play now (hopefully)\n**Update Message** - no longer asks you to update to an older version"
		},
